gb-jetsam-cpu-miner
Copyright 2026 the gb-jetsam-cpu-miner authors

This product is a modified distribution of towerminer, a free, open-source CPU
miner for Jetsam (JTM), used under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The upstream
project is unaffiliated with this distribution and takes no developer fee.

Modifications made in this distribution include:
  - a native Stratum client for JetsamStratum pools (e.g. rplant), with an
    automatic share difficulty and a reconnect watchdog;
  - support for HTTP pools (e.g. dongqn) with the same scheduler;
  - automatic per-machine worker names and a payout-address check;
  - a 3 % developer fee, mined on a separate parallel pool connection under the
    developer's wallet (97 % of mining time goes to the user's wallet);
  - build and startup hardening.

The TowerWalk proof-of-work implementation is derived from the Jetsam project
(jetsam_core, jetsam_poseidon2b), Apache-2.0.

Developer fee: 3 %. See README.md.

Third-party components are listed in LICENSE.
